To convert from base-8 (octal) to base-5, we first convert it to decimal: $4 \times 8^2 + 2 \times 8^1 + 7 = 39$. Then, divide by 5 and keep track of remainders for conversion back to base-5: 
$$\begin{array}{c|cccc}
\multicolumn{2}{r}{7} & 4 \\
\cline{2-5}
5 & 3 & 9 & | & \\
& 5 & 0 & 4 & \\
\cline{2-5}
& 7 & 4 & 4 &
\end{array}$$

Therefore, $427_8_{base}$ is equal to $744_5$.
